    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate towards oblivion in RADIANT ELUSION (\u5149\u653e\u9003\u907f), the 3D first-person arcade platformer, wherein you search for the Irrecoverable Condition locked behind the virtual gates of the Free Market! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the source of your video game nostalgia and score big by collecting the shimmering skulls of humanity, a multitude of other finite collectables, unlock up to 4 unreal abilities and experience the fantastical reality of computer interactive entertainment across ten kaleidoscopic perspectives on video game and contemporary culture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hereby invited to gaze into the RADIANT ELUSION of bright pixelated 3D-grapichs all while the electronic soundtrack numbs your corporeal self! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This product includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combo-Collectathon-system: the faster you pick up the games finite collectables the greater the score, but what you lose you lose forever, no run is the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Surfing-mechanics when in contact with angled geometry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speeding through virtual void via Shifting/Dashing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 different unlockable abilities with multiple uses that enhance intractability and moving around 3D-space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Hubworld for interactive and the possibility for nonlinear level progression! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 game endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local Time Attack-mode that saves and displays the best completion time of each of the games levels in the name of Accelerationism!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Narrative that is interwoven with the gameplay systems, its mechanics, and our civilizations current times of moving forward backwards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An euphoric electronic soundtrack and quirky VFX/SFX for satisfying audio-visual feedback!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tips:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game autosaves after completing a level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play how you want, speedy, exploratory, or both at the same time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate towards oblivion in RADIANT ELUSION (\u5149\u653e\u9003\u907f), the 3D first-person arcade platformer, wherein you search for the Irrecoverable Condition locked behind the virtual gates of the Free Market! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the source of your video game nostalgia and score big by collecting the shimmering skulls of humanity, a multitude of other finite collectables, unlock up to 4 unreal abilities and experience the fantastical reality of computer interactive entertainment across ten kaleidoscopic perspectives on video game and contemporary culture!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hereby invited to gaze into the RADIANT ELUSION of bright pixelated 3D-grapichs all while the electronic soundtrack numbs your corporeal self! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This product includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combo-Collectathon-system: the faster you pick up the games finite collectables the greater the score, but what you lose you lose forever, no run is the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Surfing-mechanics when in contact with angled geometry!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speeding through virtual void via Shifting/Dashing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 different unlockable abilities with multiple uses that enhance intractability and moving around 3D-space!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Hubworld for interactive and the possibility for nonlinear level progression! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 game endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local Time Attack-mode that saves and displays the best completion time of each of the games levels in the name of Accelerationism!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Narrative that is interwoven with the gameplay systems, its mechanics, and our civilizations current times of moving forward backwards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An euphoric electronic soundtrack and quirky VFX/SFX for satisfying audio-visual feedback!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tips:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game autosaves after completing a level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play how you want, speedy, exploratory, or both at the same time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
